'''Neko Len''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 593
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Neko Len
|name2 = Neko Len CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Neko Len CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Neko Len should be used in exclusively metal stages, as his HP is rather low otherwise. He can be used to tank metal enemies, and thanks to his 20 speed (same as [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]]) he can protect your units decently well. His dodge chance is 30% and lasts 2 seconds, so he is rather reliant on chance, however being able to stall Metal enemies completely for 2 seconds can work well in some cases. Very effective against [[Metal Doge]]s, as their damage is usually not rather high and their attack rate is fast.

However, if one happens to own [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]], then this unit will see little use.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

